  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a September 30, 2026 X post, Brian Christine said the Trump administration is harnessing super intelligence to make it easier for Americans to access information that can help them lead healthier lives. In a November 9, 2026 HHS statement, he said the TOPx challenges innovators to use AI and federal open data for patients and called the winning prototypes a promising step toward tools that help patients navigate care and clinicians better understand their needs.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In a September 30, 2026 X post, Brian Christine said the Trump administration is harnessing super intelligence to make it easier for Americans to access information that can help them lead healthier lives.",
